'''Roddy''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Backwater Bayou}} that can apply [[Rod Parts]] to [[Fishing Rods]].

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}

== Usage ==
=== Applying Rod Parts ===
To apply [[Rod Parts]] to a [[Fishing Rods|Fishing Rod]], the player can click on a [[Fishing Rods|Fishing Rod]] in their inventory and then the [[Rod Part]] they want to apply.

=== Removing Rod Parts ===
The {{Coins}} cost for removing a [[Rod Part]] scales with the Rod Part's rarity:
